{
  "_note": "首页(城市列表)的**城市槽位**:只从 `data.cities` 铺出名字与坐标,**一次网络都不打**。\n每一行的天气由那一行自己的 `canvas.depends → page/flow/detail.df` 去取 ——\n与详情页同一条流、同一个缓存桶 `c.wx.<lat>_<lon>`,所以点进详情页必然秒开,\n列表与详情页也永远是同一份数。\n由 tools/infosource/gen_weather_home.py 生成,别手改 —— 8 个槽位是写死下标展开的。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "_note": "「我的城市」= 用户数据,住 data.* 而不是 params(跨启动持久、可增删)。",
      "action": "data.get",
      "id": "saved",
      "params": {
        "key": "cities",
        "default": []
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "读取屏障(勿删):data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果。\n⚠️ v66 起不再读 `cityIdx`:「默认城市」这个隐形状态整个退役 —— 列表首页没有「当前城市」,\n/city 管理页的「点击切换」点了看不出任何变化(2026-09-25 用户报「切换没有意义」)。\n页脚加卡改用**排在第一的城市**,顺序由用户在 /city 里上移/下移决定。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n",
        "value": "$[length::(${saved})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "⚠️ 取第 0 条必须走 `$[index::()]` 的**字面**下标 —— VParser 的方括号寻址\n只认字面数字与 @last,`${saved[${i}]}` 会静默求空(整页城市名全变 `--`,零报错)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c0",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c1",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c2",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},2)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c3",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},3)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c4",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},4)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c5",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},5)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c6",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},6)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c7",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},7)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r1lat",
        "value": "${c0.lat}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r1lon",
        "value": "${c0.lon}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r1n",
        "value": "${c0.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r1w",
        "value": "${c0.where}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "URL 安全的城市名,专供行的 onClick 导航串(`/detail?…&city=${r1q}`)。\n⚠️ 编码放在数据层做,不在 onClick 串里写方法调用 —— 导航串里的**方法求值**全仓零先例,\n而 VParser 对不支持的东西静默求空:真不行时表现是「城市名整段消失」,\n不报错、只有在真机上点一次才看得见。`${}` 插值那条路是确认为真的。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r1q",
        "value": "$[urlEncode::(${c0.name})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r2lat",
        "value": "${c1.lat}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r2lon",
        "value": "${c1.lon}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r2n",
        "value": "${c1.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r2w",
        "value": "${c1.where}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r2q",
        "value": "$[urlEncode::(${c1.name})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r3lat",
        "value": "${c2.lat}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
