      "props": {
        "key": "r8q",
        "value": "$[urlEncode::(${c7.name})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "resultFilter 恒放最后;少透一个键,下游就是空参。\n⚠️ 这里**没有任何天气字段** —— 天气由每一行自己的 `canvas.depends` 去取(detail.df)。\n城市不足 8 座时后面的槽位恒空,那是正常态,L1 的空值豁免记在\ntools/infosource/params/weather/_dfrun.json。",
      "action": "resultFilter",
      "params": {
        "keys": [
          "n",
          "r1n",
          "r1w",
          "r1lat",
          "r1lon",
          "r1q",
